        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-rubrik\">C undersöks helt</p><p>C = max(−4, 3) = 3.</p></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> 3.</p></div>",
        "ledtrad": "<p>Är C en MAX- eller en MIN-nod?</p>",
